  "answer_text": "## Spiegel Catalog & Online Shopping \u2014 What You Need to Know\n\n### \ud83d\udce6 About Spiegel\n\nSpiegel was an American direct marketing retailer founded in 1865 by Joseph Spiegel. The company published a catalog \u2014 similar to competitors like Sears, Aldens, and Montgomery Ward \u2014 that advertised various brands of apparel, accessories, footwear, housewares, toys, tools, and electronics.\n\nSpiegel delivered its first mail-order catalog in 1905, and by 1925, the retailer had 10 million customers. Spiegel's buyers, who attended Paris fashion shows, introduced American women to European fashion trends.\n\n---\n\n### \u274c Is Spiegel Still Available Online?\n\nUnfortunately, **Spiegel is no longer operating**. Spiegel ran from 1865 to roughly 2019, when the brand quietly went dark under Patriarch Partners.\n\nAccording to archived references, the company abruptly ceased operations during the winter of 2019\u20132020. The website came down with no farewell letter, no closeout sale, and no press release of any consequence.\n\nAs of early 2026, spiegel.com does not resolve to a working storefront. There is no Spiegel print catalog being mailed in the United States, and no credible news of a brand revival, a buyer, or a relaunch has been found.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f Where to Find Vintage Spiegel Items\n\nIf you're a Spiegel fan or collector, here are some options:\n\n- **eBay:** Vintage Spiegel clothing turns up regularly on resale sites, and there is a small collector market for the older catalogs themselves on eBay.\n- **Etsy:** Items such as Spiegel 1970 Fall/Winter Fashion Vintage Catalogs and rare 1972 Spiegel Catalog items are available for purchase.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd04 Alternatives to Spiegel for Online Shopping\n\nTalbots, Soft Surroundings, Appleseed's, and Roaman's are all still operating and still mailing print books in 2026 \u2014 great alternatives for women's fashion in the spirit of Spiegel.\n\nYou can also explore **Catalogs.com** for a curated list of similar women's fashion catalog retailers still in operation today.",
